Package: tines
Type: Package
Title: Building the Prongs of Your Forking Paths
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "H. Sherry", "Zhang",
      email = "huizezhangsh@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
  )
Description: Documents a data analysis as a schema, a set of steps that
    each record an analytical decision in natural language. Large language
    models are used to generate and validate the R code for each step. A
    schema can be expanded with an alternative file into a multiverse of
    related analyses, making it possible to compare alternative decisions
    systematically.
